{'symbol': 'EQR', 'date': '2022-05-09 16:20:00', 'title': 'EQUITY RESIDENTIAL ANNOUNCES DEATH OF TRUSTEE RAYMOND BENNETT', 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EQUITY RESIDENTIAL (NYSE: EQR) IS DEEPLY SADDENED TO ANNOUNCE THE DEATH OF RAYMOND “RAY” BENNETT, A MEMBER OF THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF TRUSTEES SINCE 2018. MR. BENNETT, 53, WAS PRESIDENT, U.S. AND CANADA, FRANCHISING AND MANAGED BY MARRIOTT SELECT BRANDS FOR MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL, INC. (NASDAQ: MAR). “ALL OF US THAT WERE FORTUNATE TO KNOW RAY BENNETT MOURN THIS TREMENDOUS LOSS. AS A SENIOR MARRIOTT EXECUTIVE, HE BROUGHT VAST OPERATIONAL KNOWLEDGE TO EQUITY RESIDENTIAL B"}